  "short_description": "The most-handled item on any table, printed with your logo. 30 cm napkins in white or recycled kraft, one or two colours.",
  "description": "A 30 cm napkin printed in one or two colours — the item every customer touches. White or recycled kraft paper; 2-ply and 3-ply are quoted on request. Choose your options and send us your logo.\n\nMatch them to your [printed greaseproof paper](/catering-supplies/greaseproof-paper/) and [printed coasters](/catering-supplies/coasters-and-loyalty-cards/) so the whole table carries one artwork.\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
